{
  "declaredLength": 7928,
  "decoding": "confirmed-per-slot-XOR-rotate3-index-seed",
  "format": "GF Trinity encrypted UTF-16 message DAT",
  "initialKey": 0,
  "messages": [
    {
      "displayText": "Excuse-moi, jeune <U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿЄhommfille !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ+",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 428,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004500780063007500730065002D006D006F0069002C0020006A00650075006E0065002000100003110000FF04040068006F006D006D00660069006C006C006500200021001000020114002B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 39
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Aurais-tu un instant à m’accorder ?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ+",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 508,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004100750072006100690073002D0074007500200075006E00200069006E007300740061006E0074002000E00020006D2019006100630063006F00720064006500720020003F001000020114002B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 40
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Tu te souviens de moi ? Je t’avais interrogé<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿĀe\nà propos d’un Mucuscule sur un banc.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nPardonne-moi encore d’avoir douté de ta bonne\nfoi à ce moment-là.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ+",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 588,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 161
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Voilà, c’est tout. Oui, je voulais juste m’excuser\nen bonne et due forme.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ+",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 912,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 78
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Je ne peux pas te parler trop longtemps,\nje suis très occupée...<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nJe dois régler l’affaire du cambriolage au Musée\nd’Illumis !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ+",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 1068,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 133
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Un cambriolage ? C’est très grave !",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 1336,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0055006E002000630061006D006200720069006F006C0061006700650020003F00200043201900650073007400200074007200E80073002000670072006100760065002000210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 36
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Laissez-moi vous aider !",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 1408,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004C00610069007300730065007A002D006D006F006900200076006F00750073002000610069006400650072002000210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 25
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Ah non, il n’y a pas vraiment eu de cambriolage !\nC’est une simulation, pour nous entraîner !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ+",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 1460,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 98
    },
    {
      "displayText": "À Illumis, nous suivons régulièrement\ndes entraînements de ce type.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nDans le scénario d’aujourd’hui, c’est le musée\nqui est pris pour cible !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ+",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 1656,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 148
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Oh, mais attends...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ+",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 1952,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004F0068002C0020006D00610069007300200061007400740065006E00640073002E002E002E001000020114002B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Tu pourrais nous être utile ! J’ai vu tes talents\nen combat, tu feras parfaitement l’affaire !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ+",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 2000,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 99
    },
    {
      "displayText": "On a besoin de quelqu’un pour jouer le rôle d<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿЁue la\nvoleu<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿȁrse qui prend pour cible le Musée d’Illumis !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ+",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 2200,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 116
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Si ça t’intéresse, fais-moi signe !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ+",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 2432,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00530069002000E700610020007420190069006E007400E900720065007300730065002C00200066006100690073002D006D006F00690020007300690067006E006500200021001000020114002B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 40
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+000D>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 2512,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF000D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Alors, tu es prêt<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿĀe à cambrioler le musée ?\nEuh, je veux dire, faire semblant de le cambrioler ?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ+",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 2524,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 105
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Je suis prêt<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿĀe pour le rôle !",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 2736,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004A00650020007300750069007300200070007200EA007400100003110000FF0100006500200070006F007500720020006C00650020007200F4006C0065002000210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 34
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Pas encore.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 2804,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00500061007300200065006E0063006F00720065002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 12
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Oh, je t’en prie ! J’ai vraiment besoin de\nton soutien pour cet entraînement !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ+",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 2828,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 83
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Dans ce cas, commençons l’entraînement !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ+",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 2996,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00440061006E00730020006300650020006300610073002C00200063006F006D006D0065006E00E7006F006E00730020006C20190065006E00740072006100EE006E0065006D0065006E007400200021001000020114002B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 45
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Voilà comment ça va se dérouler : tu vas entrer\ndans le musée par la porte principale.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nTon objectif, c’est de voler la tenue de l’ancien\npeuple de Sinnoh au premier étage.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nEn chemin, des policiers vont tenter de t’arrêter.\nBats-toi contre eux quand ils te défient !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ+",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 3088,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 276
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Mais attention, ces policiers forment l’élite\ndes combattants ! Ne les sous-estime pas !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ+",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 3640,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 93
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Quand tu seras prêt<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿĀe, saute du toit.\nL’entraînement commencera à ce moment-là !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ+",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 3828,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 89
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0016>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 4008,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00160000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "As-tu perdu ton chemin ? Tu dois entrer dans\nle musée par l’entrée principale !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ+",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 4020,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 84
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0018>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 4188,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00180000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Stop ! Si tu ne t’arrêtes pas,\nje te défierai en combat Pokémon !<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n... C’est bien ça qu’il faut que je dise ?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǍ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 4200,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 116
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+001A>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 4432,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF001A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "L’entraînement est un échec !\nIl faut tout recommencer depuis le début !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ+",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 27,
      "offsetInSection": 4444,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 77
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+001C>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 28,
      "offsetInSection": 4600,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF001C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Euh... L<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿāea voleu<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿȁrse est passé<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿĀe en force !\n<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿЂIlElle se dirige vers vous !<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n... C’est ça la réplique, hein ?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǍ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 12,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 29,
      "offsetInSection": 4612,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 131
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+001E>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 30,
      "offsetInSection": 4876,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF001E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Hiii ! Un cambriolage !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ#",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 31,
      "offsetInSection": 4888,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00480069006900690020002100200055006E002000630061006D006200720069006F006C0061006700650020002100100002011400230000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 28
    },
    {
      "displayText": "L<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿईe voleura voleuse est sûrement venu<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿĀe dérober la tenue\nde l’ancien peuple de Sinnoh au premier étage !<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nOh là là, quel drame !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ#",
      "escapedControlUnits": 8,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 32,
      "offsetInSection": 4944,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 143
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Hiiii ! Un cambriolage ! <U+0010><U+0002>봊\nText_icon1",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 33,
      "offsetInSection": 5232,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004800690069006900690020002100200055006E002000630061006D006200720069006F006C00610067006500200021002000100002BD0A000A0054006500780074005F00690063006F006E00310000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 40
    },
    {
      "displayText": "La tenue de l’ancien peuple\nde Sinnoh ! Oh là là ! <U+0010><U+0002>봊\nText_icon1",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 34,
      "offsetInSection": 5312,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004C0061002000740065006E007500650020006400650020006C20190061006E006300690065006E00200070006500750070006C0065000A00640065002000530069006E006E006F0068002000210020004F00680020006C00E00020006C00E000200021002000100002BD0A000A0054006500780074005F00690063006F006E00310000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 66
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿#",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 35,
      "offsetInSection": 5444,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00230000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Cesse tout de suite tes agissements, voleu<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿȁrse !\nAu nom de la loi, je t’arrête !<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǍ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 36,
      "offsetInSection": 5456,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 89
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿%",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 37,
      "offsetInSection": 5636,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00250000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "L<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿāea voleu<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿȁrse a brisé nos... euh ma ligne\nde défense ! <U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿЂIlElle a traversé l’accueil !<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǍ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 8,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 38,
      "offsetInSection": 5648,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 103
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Quand ce qui s’est passé à l’entraînement va\ns’ébruiter, on va me passer un savon...<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǍ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 39,
      "offsetInSection": 5856,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 89
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿(",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 40,
      "offsetInSection": 6036,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00280000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Plus un geste !<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǍ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 41,
      "offsetInSection": 6048,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0050006C0075007300200075006E0020006700650073007400650020002100100002011401CD0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 20
    },
    {
      "displayText": "C’est peut-être qu’un entraînement, mais moi,\nje ne compte pas perdre ce combat !<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǍ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 42,
      "offsetInSection": 6088,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 86
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿+",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 43,
      "offsetInSection": 6260,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF002B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Vous avez réussi à (faire semblant de) voler\nla tenue de l’ancien peuple de Sinnoh !",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 44,
      "offsetInSection": 6272,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 85
    },
    {
      "displayText": "On a volé la tenue de l’ancien peuple de Sinnoh !\n<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000> l’as du casse a encore frappé !<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nÀ toutes les unités ! Déployez un périmètre\nde sécurité autour de la ville !<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n... C’est ça la réplique ?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǍ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 9,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 45,
      "offsetInSection": 6444,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 201
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 46,
      "offsetInSection": 6848,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "C’était une belle séance d’entraînement, mais\nj’ai honte d’écrire un rapport sur cette débâcle...<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǍ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 47,
      "offsetInSection": 6860,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 102
    },
    {
      "displayText": "La prochaine séance risque d’être encore pire\nque celle-ci...<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǍ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 48,
      "offsetInSection": 7064,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004C0061002000700072006F0063006800610069006E00650020007300E90061006E00630065002000720069007300710075006500200064201900EA00740072006500200065006E0063006F0072006500200070006900720065000A007100750065002000630065006C006C0065002D00630069002E002E002E00100002011401CD0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 66
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Tout ceci ne serait pas arrivé si l’agente Lisanne\nn’avait pas recruté <U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000> !<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿЂIlElle est beaucoup trop fort<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿĀe pour nous !<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǍ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 11,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 49,
      "offsetInSection": 7196,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 138
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Voyons ! Il faut voir le bon côté des choses.\nMaintenant, vous avez un objectif à atteindre !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ+",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 50,
      "offsetInSection": 7472,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 98
    },
    {
      "displayText": "La police doit pouvoir faire face à tous les dangers\npour protéger Illumis !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ+",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 51,
      "offsetInSection": 7668,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 81
